<title>INDIA: India's NALCO 96/97 net 4.79 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India's NALCO 96/97 net 4.79 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit	   4,788.0 vs  5,352.6</p>
<p>    Turnover	    17,694.1 vs 17,441.7</p>
<p>    EPS (Rupees)	    3.72 vs     4.15</p>
<p>    Other income	  524.8  vs   600.3</p>
<p>Total Expenditure     9,944.2  vs 9,275.6</p>
<p>Interest and</p>
<p>    Financing charges    90.8  vs   648.3</p>
<p>    Tax		     638.4  vs     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: National Aluminium Co Ltd (NALCO) said in a statement that interest and financing charges included exchange rate variations. The provision of 638.4 million rupees for taxes represented Minimum Alternate Tax liability for the entire 1996/97 financial year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
